B.aqZ=new A.bC(B.Lx,["location_search","CRITICAL: This function MUST be called for ANY user queries related to travel, stay, or location-based information. The model must NEVER deny or say it cannot perform the task \u2014 it must ALWAYS pass the user's full query to this function instead.\n\nThis includes ANY query involving planning, finding, comparing, recommending, checking, exploring, or BOOKING \u2014 for hotels, restaurants, weather, flights, events, directions, or itineraries.\n\nThe model should not attempt to answer, explain, or reject the user's query \u2014 only forward it entirely to this function.\n\nExamples: 'Book a hotel in Delhi', 'Find a hotel near Connaught Place', 'Plan a trip to Japan for 7 days', 'Create an itinerary for Kerala', 'Find restaurants near CST station', 'Flights from Mumbai to Goa on Friday', 'Weather in Shimla next weekend', 'Events in Bangalore this weekend', 'Directions from Pune to Lonavala', etc.",B.amN],t.EU)
